      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lat_Krabang_district",
      "category": "transport",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Lat Krabang's landscape is dotted with canals, including Khlong Prawet Burirom, where rice was once traded by boat.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        9,
